editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:30:- **Who knows the integration mechanism:** Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln and Oryn — six. Oryn knows sources by Path and not by person except those she has touched; she does not know Seln supplied Shadow-adjacent. **Not** Vastin, Teague, Pike or Cleon. All six know the still-place phenomenon; only Cael and Oryn are shown hearing/saying its label. Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis and Seln know the fourth-site survey; Oryn, Teague and Pike do not know that result at entry. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 4]
